WEBVTT

00:00:28.297 --> 00:00:31.463
And I read all of the stories
about those great innovators

00:00:31.463 --> 00:00:33.030
and entrepreneurs out there.

00:00:33.497 --> 00:00:38.097
And one of the stories I really love
is that of Martha Matilda Harper.

00:00:38.563 --> 00:00:41.497
This was a lady who came from a
relatively poor background,

00:00:41.763 --> 00:00:47.463
worked most of her career over 20 years
as a servant and with three hundred

00:00:47.463 --> 00:00:52.097
and sixty dollars in life savings.
She launched a hair salon.

00:00:52.397 --> 00:00:53.830
Now, she didn't stop there.

00:00:54.063 --> 00:00:58.297
She went on to create a global
network of hair salons.

00:00:58.763 --> 00:01:03.197
And she licensed this actually to women
like herself from poor backgrounds with